@startuml
title Conditional styles and condition widget output
' Traces: OMCT-C10-L2-02.01, OMCT-C10-L2-02.02
participant "Condition Set View" as ConditionSet
participant "Condition Result Service" as Results
participant "Styled Object View" as StyledView
participant "Style Rule Manager" as Styles
participant "Condition Widget View" as Widget

ConditionSet -> Results: publish(activeOutput)
activate Results
Results -> StyledView: outputChanged(activeOutput)
activate StyledView
StyledView -> Styles: replaceConditionalStyles(activeOutput.styles)
activate Styles
Styles --> StyledView: styles applied
deactivate Styles
StyledView --> Results: styled object refreshed
deactivate StyledView
Results -> Widget: outputChanged(activeOutput)
activate Widget
Widget -> Widget: render(label, url, styles)
Widget --> Results: widget content refreshed
deactivate Widget
Results --> ConditionSet: subscribers updated
deactivate Results
@enduml
